WEBVTT

00:08:27.962 --> 00:08:30.214
One, two, three, four, five.

00:08:30.464 --> 00:08:32.424
And all this trash in this grate, too.

00:08:33.175 --> 00:08:34.176
Much better.

00:08:34.176 --> 00:08:37.388
Storm grates like that is exactly
how trash enters the ocean,

00:08:37.388 --> 00:08:38.514
and we don’t want that.

00:08:38.514 --> 00:08:42.685
There are already over 5.25 trillion
pieces of trash in our oceans.

00:08:42.977 --> 00:08:44.395
Let’s not let in any more.

00:08:47.064 --> 00:08:48.065
(Applause and cheers)

00:08:53.571 --> 00:08:55.072
ZB: We’re not naive.

00:08:55.072 --> 00:08:56.657
We know the details and the data

00:08:56.657 --> 00:08:59.201
that speak to the devastation
of the climate crisis

00:08:59.201 --> 00:09:00.452
like the back of our hands